---

# ⚙️ Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/olist-ecommerce-analytics.git
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

# ▶️ Run the Application

```bash
python app.py
```

